  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Folke Bernadotte Academy&apos;s contribution to the strategy for Sweden&apos;s bilateral development cooperation with Myanmar 2018-2022.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademins bidrag till strategi f&#xF6;r Sveriges bilaterala utvecklingssamarbete med Myanmar 2018-2022.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FBA will contribute to the Swedish governments&apos; development strategy for Myanmar. The FBA work shall contribute to strengthened capacity for inclusive peace building and dialogue, as well as to improved respect for and use of rule of law.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FBA:s verksamhet inom ramen f&#xF6;r regeringens bilaterala strategin f&#xF6;r Myanmar 2018-2022 ska bidra till st&#xE4;rkt kapacitet till inkluderande fredsbyggande och dialog, och till st&#xE4;rkt respekt f&#xF6;r och till&#xE4;mpning av r&#xE4;ttsstatens principer.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Folke Bernadotte Academy contributes peacebuilding and rule of law in Myanmar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin bidrar till fredsbyggande och r&#xE4;ttsstatens principer i Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
